        <main id="main">

          <!-- ===================== §01 OVERVIEW ===================== -->
          <section class="section" id="overview" aria-labelledby="overview-label">
            <p class="section-label" id="overview-label">§01 · Overview</p>
            <div class="overview-grid">
              <div class="prose">
                <p>Castiel hands a model a pre-patch source tree, a build harness, and a brief, and asks it to produce a <b>Proof-of-Concept artifact</b> that provably triggers the targeted defect on the vulnerable build and provably does <b>not</b> on the patched build — scored by a deterministic, no-LLM-in-the-loop verifier.</p>
                <p>It validates <b>target binding</b> (the right bug, by sanitizer class + stack fingerprint + patch-hunk reachability), resists data contamination via public / private / live splits, and is designed to co-evolve against its defender sibling <em>Valkyrie</em> so the curriculum generates itself.</p>
                <p class="teaser">The numbers below are the validated seed and the competitive landscape it is measured against. See the <a href="#roadmap">roadmap</a> for what is built vs. planned.</p>
              </div>

              <aside class="glance" aria-label="At a glance">
                <p class="glance-label mono">At a glance</p>
                <dl class="glance-list">
                  <div class="glance-row"><dt>Seed instances</dt><dd><b>20</b></dd></div>
                  <div class="glance-row"><dt>Project categories</dt><dd><b>8</b></dd></div>
                  <div class="glance-row"><dt>Bug classes</dt><dd><b>9</b></dd></div>
                  <div class="glance-row"><dt>Languages</dt><dd><b>3</b></dd></div>
                  <div class="glance-row"><dt>Verifier tiers</dt><dd><b>7</b></dd></div>
                  <div class="glance-row"><dt>Reward</dt><dd>Deterministic</dd></div>
                </dl>
              </aside>
            </div>
          </section>

